          "**Burden**: about **1.67 million deaths in India in 2019 (17.8% of all deaths)**; ambient PM deaths are rising while household air pollution deaths have fallen as LPG spread. [Lancet Planet Health 2021]",
          "**Outdoor air pollution and particulate matter are IARC Group 1 carcinogens** (2013). [IARC 2013]",
          "**Noise** is unwanted sound; effects are **auditory** (temporary threshold shift, permanent noise-induced hearing loss with a **4 kHz notch**) and **non-auditory** (annoyance, sleep disturbance, reduced efficiency, hypertension, ischaemic heart disease). [Park 28e]",
